@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Green Rides

[*] --> Login

state "Login" as Login
Login : entry / User logs in
Login : do / Authenticate user
Login : exit / Display journey details if successful

Login --> [*] : [Invalid login credentials]

Login --> JourneyDetails : [Valid login and destination selection]

state "Journey Details" as JourneyDetails
JourneyDetails : entry / Display journey details
JourneyDetails : do / Show driving mode options or other alternatives
JourneyDetails : exit / User selects an option

JourneyDetails --> DrivingMode : [User chooses driving mode]
DrivingMode : entry / Activate driving mode
DrivingMode : do / Send notifications during driving
DrivingMode : exit / Continue journey or end

state "Other Options" as OtherOptions
OtherOptions : entry / Display alternative options
OtherOptions : do / Show other available features
OtherOptions : exit / User selects an option

JourneyDetails --> OtherOptions : [User chooses another option]

state "Place to Eat" as PlaceToEat
PlaceToEat : entry / Select a place to eat
PlaceToEat : do / View menu and place order if hungry
PlaceToEat : exit / Continue journey or end

DrivingMode --> PlaceToEat : [User is hungry]
OtherOptions --> PlaceToEat : [User chooses to eat]

state "Accident" as Accident
Accident : entry / Inform authorities in case of an accident
Accident : do / Send notifications and alert relevant parties
Accident : exit / Continue journey or end

DrivingMode --> Accident : [Accident occurs]
PlaceToEat --> Accident : [Accident occurs while eating]

state "Feedback" as Feedback
Feedback : entry / Provide feedback upon completion of journey
Feedback : do / Collect user feedback
Feedback : exit / End journey

JourneyDetails --> Feedback : [User completes journey]
DrivingMode --> Feedback : [User completes journey]
OtherOptions --> Feedback : [User completes journey]
PlaceToEat --> Feedback : [User completes journey]
Accident --> Feedback : [User completes journey]

state End <<choice>>
End --> [*]

@enduml
